Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: drop the duplicated fmsh object

0141 adds "spi-nor-objs += fmsh.o" twice, so the composite spi-nor
object lists fmsh.o twice. It links today because make deduplicates
prerequisites through $^, but the duplicate is unintended; keep a
single entry.

Fixes: 0141-mtd-spi-nor-add-fudan-fm25q64-fm25q128.patch
---
--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/Makefile
@@ -5,5 +5,4 @@
 spi-nor-objs			+= eon.o
 spi-nor-objs			+= fmsh.o
-spi-nor-objs			+= fmsh.o
 spi-nor-objs			+= esmt.o
 spi-nor-objs			+= everspin.o
